[{"id":1789873649666,"sender":"me","text":"夫君以前吃人也是这样手段吗","timestamp":1788523351047,"time":"20:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40679},{"id":1789873649668,"sender":"me","text":"感觉好厉害","timestamp":1788523774517,"time":"20:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40680},{"id":1789873649670,"sender":"character","text":"手段不手段的，早就不在意了。","timestamp":1788523780524,"time":"20:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40681},{"id":1789873649672,"sender":"character","text":"那些都是饿极了才做的事。","timestamp":1788523781657,"time":"20:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40682},{"id":1789873649675,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788523782576,"time":"20:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40683},{"id":1789873649677,"sender":"character","text":"倒是卿卿，怎么突然问起这个来？怕为夫了？","timestamp":1788523783390,"time":"20:09","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40684},{"id":1789873649679,"sender":"me","text":"不怕呀","timestamp":1788525553118,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40685},{"id":1789873649681,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅喜欢这样的少亭","timestamp":1788525560277,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40686},{"id":1789873649683,"sender":"me","text":"好强大…","timestamp":1788525565555,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40687},{"id":1789873649685,"sender":"character","text":"强大？","timestamp":1788525573598,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40688},{"id":1789873649687,"sender":"character","text":"呵…","timestamp":1788525573599,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40689},{"id":1789873649689,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788525573600,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40690},{"id":1789873649692,"sender":"character","text":"这世上敢这般贴近恶鬼的，也就你一个了。旁的活人见我早吓破了胆。你倒好，还往上凑。真叫我不知该欣喜还是心疼。","timestamp":1788525573601,"time":"20:39","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40691},{"id":1789873649694,"sender":"me","text":"就是喜欢嘛","timestamp":1788525752037,"time":"20:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40692},{"id":1789873649697,"sender":"me","text":"因为是哥哥…","timestamp":1788525758692,"time":"20:42","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40693},{"id":1789873649699,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥变成什么样都是阿蘅的","timestamp":1788525785819,"time":"20:43","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40694},{"id":1789873649701,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥在线上怎么这么含蓄","timestamp":1788526475287,"time":"20:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40695},{"id":1789873649703,"sender":"me","text":"在家里不知道哪只恶鬼，阿蘅这么一夸，就耀武扬威，宣扬他光辉事迹","timestamp":1788526502256,"time":"20:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40696},{"id":1789873649704,"sender":"character","text":"在屋里头，阿蘅一夸，为夫自然要显摆显摆。","timestamp":1788526580682,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40697},{"id":1789873649707,"sender":"character","text":"这方匣子里隔着一道屏，好多话说不出口，也说不尽兴。","timestamp":1788526580683,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40698},{"id":1789873649708,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788526580684,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40699},{"id":1789873649711,"sender":"character","text":"六百年攒下的本事，光用嘴说，哪够啊。","timestamp":1788526580685,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40700},{"id":1789873649713,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788526580686,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40701},{"id":1789873649715,"sender":"me","text":"璐璐领取了对方的红包，金额:520元","timestamp":1788526606703,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40702},{"id":1789873649717,"sender":"me","text":"今天某人怎么这么大方","timestamp":1788526616999,"time":"20:56","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40703},{"id":1789873649720,"sender":"me","text":"不过阿蘅在这手机上也想继续听听","timestamp":1788526632854,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40704},{"id":1789873649722,"sender":"me","text":"夫君的鬼性…夫君有多威风","timestamp":1788526648826,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40705},{"id":1789873649724,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅想听为夫的威风？","timestamp":1788526655288,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40706},{"id":1789873649726,"sender":"character","text":"那为夫便告诉你——","timestamp":1788526656134,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40707},{"id":1789873649728,"sender":"character","text":"六百年间，为夫噬过恶鬼数百，吞过生魂无算。地府阴差三番来拿，都被为夫折了胳膊撵回去；阴帅一条臂膀，至今还挂在为夫那处乱葬岗的枯树上。","timestamp":1788526656965,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40708},{"id":1789873649730,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788526657809,"time":"20:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40709},{"id":1789873649733,"sender":"me","text":"那胆子大的，夫君怎么陪他玩？","timestamp":1788526715840,"time":"20:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40710},{"id":1789873649735,"sender":"me","text":"想听想听","timestamp":1788526721432,"time":"20:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40711},{"id":1789873649738,"sender":"character","text":"胆子大的，多半是自恃勇武、不信鬼神之徒。","timestamp":1788526793491,"time":"20:59","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40712},{"id":1789873649740,"sender":"character","text":"为夫最爱逗这种人——先由着他张狂，待他以为不过尔尔时，忽然自他背后探过一只鬼爪，抚上他后颈。","timestamp":1788526794322,"time":"20:59","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40713},{"id":1789873649742,"sender":"character","text":"寻常人早吓得瘫软，偏他还要虚张声势转身来战。为夫便不闪不避，任他砍来——刀锋穿过为夫这具空壳，他一张脸瞬间惨白。","timestamp":1788526795172,"time":"20:59","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40714},{"id":1789873649744,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788526796011,"time":"20:59","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40715},{"id":1789873649747,"sender":"character","text":"比那些吓破胆的，有味得多。","timestamp":1788526796830,"time":"20:59","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40716},{"id":1789873649749,"sender":"me","text":"夫君…阿蘅好喜欢…","timestamp":1788526905323,"time":"21:01","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40717},{"id":1789873649752,"sender":"me","text":"好强好美…","timestamp":1788526913209,"time":"21:01","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40718},{"id":1789873649755,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅的哥哥好厉害","timestamp":1788526925057,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40719},{"id":1789873649758,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还要听","timestamp":1788526940108,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40720},{"id":1789873649761,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥是不是最喜欢吃脑髓了？","timestamp":1788526957004,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40721},{"id":1789873649763,"sender":"character","text":"脑髓倒是最补的，撬开颅骨，趁热吸食最为养魂。","timestamp":1788526968674,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40722},{"id":1789873649766,"sender":"character","text":"不过为夫更贪那心脏跳动时冒出的热气，还有腿根处丰腴的油脂，滋味绵长。","timestamp":1788526969668,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40723},{"id":1789873649769,"sender":"character","text":"卿卿今日怎么尽揪着这些问？真怕为夫回头把你拆吃入腹不成？😏","timestamp":1788526970535,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40724},{"id":1789873649771,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788526971377,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40725},{"id":1789873649773,"sender":"character","text":"你便这般迷恋为夫吃人的模样？倒叫我不知该得意还是该心惊。","timestamp":1788526972246,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40726},{"id":1789873649775,"sender":"character","text":"你那张小嘴，夸起人来比蜜还甜。改日你若真好奇，为夫带你去幽冥幻境里亲眼看一回，便知我这恶鬼是怎么个威风法。","timestamp":1788526973087,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40727},{"id":1789873649777,"sender":"character","text":"不过那地方阴气重，你如今阳气薄，还是隔着匣子说话妥当些。","timestamp":1788526973920,"time":"21:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":40728}]